计算/工程仿真软件的安装、编译和性能优化。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-14T15:22:51","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"7f1bfbab-d390-4c86-9a19-93a7dd582ad8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151174934,"PostDateInt":1775717710000,"PostDate":"2026-04-09T14:55:10","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"资深优化专家（北京）(J13675)","OrgId":2525875,"Org":"曙光智算","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"50K-100K 元/月","Duty":"1. 研发高质量的芯片基础软件栈，包括支撑大语言模型在内的深度学习，线性代数，科学计算，信号处理等方向的基础加速库；\n2. 分析重要的性能指标，调优已有软件算法，并且对未来的软件进行优化和提升；\n3. 对大语言模型，CV模型，语音模型，推荐系统，科学计算和其他相关并行算法领域进行分析和优化；\n4. 负责 AI模型推理/训练的端到端性能整体优化；\n5. 实现AI/科学计算领域在GPGPU上的算法和实践。\n6.参与主流大模型（DeepSeek、通义、LLaMA等）的推理算子开发和优化，提高大模型推理性能；参与W8A8 等量化算法的研究和相应高性能算子开发；参与投机采样、MTP、专家负载均衡、计算/通信 Overlap 等创新推理优化特性的研发；","Require":"1. 熟悉 C++编程，了解常用数据结构及算法；\n2. 熟悉线性代数，科学计算，机器学习，深度学习，AI算法等一个或多个领域；\n3. 熟悉 GPU 或 AI加速芯片的体系结构，有过在不同架构芯片上的算法调优经验；\n4. 熟悉并行算法优化的基本技巧，有对算法性能进行分析和优化的经验；\n5. 熟悉计算机体系结构，操作系统；\n6. 以下情况优先：\n（1）GPU的编程和优化经验，e.g. CUDA or OpenCL，有过类CUDA生态的底层计算库（cuBLAS/cuDNN/cuFFT/cuSOLVER等）的开发经验，或者对这些计算库的构成和使用非常熟悉；\n（2）有过机器学习方面的开发经验，尤其是深度学习，熟悉Tensorflow, Pytorch, TensorRT等框架/引擎的原理和使用方法；\n（3）熟悉convolution、GEMM、Attention等计算密集型运算的典型算法，有过实际开发经验优先，有过视觉/大语言模型的开发和调优经验，熟悉CNN/Transformer等网络的性能瓶颈和优化方向，能够把握相关领域的国际前沿发展趋势；\n（4）有过数据科学，统计科学，图像处理，信号处理等方面的开发和优化经历；\n（5）有软硬件协同优化、基于异构硬件的软件开发经验者优先。\n（6）具备 NPU/GPU 等 AI 加速器的性能调优经验，熟悉内存优化、算子融合等技术。熟悉 AI 推理框架，有模型部署和优化实战经验。\n（7）参与过 Triton、MLIR、IREE、XLA、TVM、TorchInductor 等编译器的开发，或在 GitHub 提交过相关 PR。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"博士研究生","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-09T14:55:10","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"